      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "What is the deepest "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "spot",
            "ref": "v-spot"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in the ocean? Well, let’s "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "pass through",
            "zh": "穿过"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " different ocean "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "zones",
            "ref": "v-zone"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to get there!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "First is the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "sunlight zone",
            "zh": "日光区"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Here are the brightest "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "waters",
            "zh": "水域"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". We may see some fish, turtles or "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "jellyfish",
            "zh": "水母"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " swimming around."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Then, we come to the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "twilight zone",
            "zh": "暮光区"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". It starts to get darker. Some fish make their own light."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Next, we get to the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "midnight zone",
            "zh": "午夜区"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". It’s cold and dark. The only light comes from animals that make their own."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "After that, we come to the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "abyssal zone",
            "zh": "深渊区"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". No sunlight can reach here. There are no plants and very few "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "creatures",
            "ref": "v-creature"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Even deeper than the abyssal zone is the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "hadal zone",
            "zh": "超深渊区"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Here we find the Challenger Deep*. It’s the deepest spot in the ocean at about 11,000 metres underwater. It’s "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "extremely",
            "ref": "v-extremely"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " cold there, but life can still be found."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "There is so much more to explore in the deep ocean."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "n1",
        "type": "note",
        "title": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Did you know?"
          }
        ],
        "content": [
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "*挑战者深渊（the Challenger Deep），位于太平洋马里亚纳海沟最深处，同时也是世界上海洋最深的地方。"
            }
          ]
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
